How to use
Type /bmhh to show/hide the frame.
Drag the frame anywhere you like.
Pet line: Turns red and says UNHAPPY - FEED! when your pet needs food.
Kill Command line:
Grey = waiting for a crit
Green = READY (you just crit and the cooldown is up)
Yellow = on cooldown

Notes for OctoWoW
Crit detection on pure 1.12 can be a bit imperfect depending on combat log messages. If it doesn’t catch every crit reliably, tell me and I can harden it further.
Kill Command on OctoWoW is only usable after your crit (not the pet’s). The addon tracks that window.
The addon is deliberately very lightweight so it works well on the 1.12 client.
Would you like me to also add:
A louder warning (sound + big text) when the pet becomes Unhappy?
Automatic suggestion of which food in your bags is best for the current pet?
A bigger, more visible Kill Command proc indicator?
Just say which extras you want and I’ll update the code.
